  "releaseNotes": "This version based on commit https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/commit/7c1a090d5743991769aa3ef7ffa3490a9bd99391\n\nFix ci, update dotnet sdk (#537)\n\n* Update CI to .NET 11 SDK\n\n* Pin CI to last known-good .NET SDK\n\n* Target browser demo at .NET 11\n\n* Enable self-contained net11 browser runtime\n\n* Run CI for demo project changes\n\n* Avoid native WASM rebuild on net11\n\n* Defer browser AOT to publish\n\n* Install wasm-tools workload before build\n\n* Use Mono runtime flavor for net11 browser build\n\n* Migrate browser demo to Microsoft.NET.Sdk.WebAssembly\n\n* Restore workflow path filtering",
